<title>THAILAND: Dhana Siam to pay 2.00 baht 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Dhana Siam to pay 2.00 baht 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  2.00    vs    2.75</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	April 25, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Dhana Siam Finance and Securities Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662-2529950)</p>
</text>
